    "htmlCode": "<button class=\"button\">\n  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" class=\"svgIcon\"><path d=\"M135.2 17.7L128 32H32C14.3 32 0 46.3 0 64S14.3 96 32 96H416c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32s-14.3-32-32-32H320l-7.2-14.3C307.4 6.8 296.3 0 284.2 0H163.8c-12.1 0-23.2 6.8-28.6 17.7zM416 128H32L53.2 467c1.6 25.3 22.6 45 47.9 45H346.9c25.3 0 46.3-19.7 47.9-45L416 128z\"></path></svg>\n</button>",
